|               | (4) simplification         | 2,177        | simplification of design after performance transformations                             |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                            |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering               | 2,017        | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
|               | (2) optimizations          | 1,586        | high level synthesis optimizations                                                     |
